       <div class=\"lgd-row\">\n                      <aside class=\"lgd-row__one-forth sidebar sidebar--first\">\n              \n  \n  \n      \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--sidebar-first region region-sidebar-first\">\n\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--sidebar-first\">\n      <div class=\"views-exposed-form block block-views block-views-exposed-filter-blocklocalgov-events-search-events-page\" data-drupal-selector=\"views-exposed-form-localgov-events-search-events-page\" id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-events-search-scarfolk\">\n  \n    \n      <form action=\"/events/search\" method=\"get\" id=\"views-exposed-form-localgov-events-search-events-page\" accept-charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  \n\n<div class=\"js-form-item form-item js-form-type-textfield form-item-search js-form-item-search\">\n      <label for=\"edit-search--2\">Search</label>\n          <input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-search\" type=\"text\" id=\"edit-search--2\" name=\"search\" value=\"screening\" size=\"30\" maxlength=\"128\" class=\"form-text\" />\n\n      </div>\n<div data-drupal-selector=\"edit-actions--3\" class=\"form-actions js-form-wrapper form-wrapper\" id=\"edit-actions--3--mgpN6n8cdsA\"><input data-drupal-selector=\"edit-submit-localgov-events-search-2\" type=\"submit\" id=\"edit-submit-localgov-events-search--2\" value=\"Apply\" class=\"button js-form-submit form-submit\" />\n</div>\n\n\n</form>\n\n  </div>\n<div class=\"facet-inactive block-facet--dropdown block block-facets block-facet-blocklocalgov-events-price\" id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-events-cost-scarfolk--2\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"facets-widget-dropdown\">\n      <h2>Price</h2><ul data-drupal-facet-filter-key=\"f\" data-drupal-facet-id=\"localgov_events_price\" data-drupal-facet-alias=\"cost\" class=\"facet-inactive js-facets-dropdown-links item-list__dropdown facet-filter-checkboxes\"><li class=\"facet-item\"><a href=\"/events/search?search=screening&amp;f%5B0%5D=cost%3A1\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-drupal-facet-item-id=\"cost-1\" data-drupal-facet-item-value=\"1\" data-drupal-facet-item-count=\"5\" data-drupal-facet-filter-value=\"cost:1\" data-drupal-facet-widget-element-class=\"facets-dropdown\"><span class=\"facet-item__value\">Free</span>\n</a></li><li class=\"facet-item\"><a href=\"/events/search?search=screening&amp;f%5B0%5D=cost%3A2\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-drupal-facet-item-id=\"cost-2\" data-drupal-facet-item-value=\"2\" data-drupal-facet-item-count=\"1\" data-drupal-facet-filter-value=\"cost:2\" data-drupal-facet-widget-element-class=\"facets-dropdown\"><span class=\"facet-item__value\">Paid</span>\n</a></li></ul></div>\n\n  </div>\n<div class=\"facet-inactive block-facet--dropdown block block-facets block-facet-blocklocalgov-events-category\" id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-events-category-scarfolk--2\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"facets-widget-dropdown\">\n      <h2>Category</h2><ul data-drupal-facet-filter-key=\"f\" data-drupal-facet-id=\"localgov_events_category\" data-drupal-facet-alias=\"category\" class=\"facet-inactive js-facets-dropdown-links item-list__dropdown facet-filter-checkboxes\"><li class=\"facet-item\"><a href=\"/events/search?search=screening&amp;f%5B0%5D=category%3A171\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-drupal-facet-item-id=\"category-171\" data-drupal-facet-item-value=\"171\" data-drupal-facet-item-count=\"5\" data-drupal-facet-filter-value=\"category:171\" data-drupal-facet-widget-element-class=\"facets-dropdown\"><span class=\"facet-item__value\">Climate change events</span>\n</a></li><li class=\"facet-item\"><a href=\"/events/search?search=screening&amp;f%5B0%5D=category%3A172\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-drupal-facet-item-id=\"category-172\" data-drupal-facet-item-value=\"172\" data-drupal-facet-item-count=\"1\" data-drupal-facet-filter-value=\"category:172\" data-drupal-facet-widget-element-class=\"facets-dropdown\"><span class=\"facet-item__value\">Things to do</span>\n</a></li></ul></div>\n\n  </div>\n<div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-eventbutton\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-content8b7d10e3-aa73-4dfa-8061-a7a9b3d282e3\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-event-button-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item\"><p><a class=\"button new-event-button\" href=\"/node/add/localgov_event\">Submit a new event</a></p></div>\n      \n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n            </aside>\n            <div class=\"lgd-row__two-thirds\">\n              <div class=\"padding-horizontal\">\n                \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--content region region-content\">\n\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--content\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-mainpagecontent-scarfolk--2\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"views-element-container\"><div class=\"view view-localgov-events-search view-id-localgov_events_search view-display-id-events_page js-view-dom-id-d3e8792fd34ee31e9d7590629a787762c46ebb39a29ee711ae44c666d7d3f139\">\n  \n    \n      \n      <div class=\"view-content\">\n          <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/kingston-international-film-festival\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">Kingston International Film Festival </a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Paid</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>Kingston International Film Festival Opens Box Office for its Fifth Year! The festival returns with three days of screenings, workshops, and events and will be taking place from 5–7 June across four venues in Kingston.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/peoples-emergency-briefing\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">People&#039;s Emergency Briefing</a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-06-22T14:00:00Z\">Monday 22 June 2026, 2.00pm</time>\n-<time datetime=\"2026-06-22T16:30:00Z\">Monday 22 June 2026, 4.30pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Free</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>Kingston University, in collaboration with Kingston Council, invites you to a screening of The People’s Emergency Briefing as part of London Climate Action Week 2026.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/peoples-emergency-briefing-cornerhouse-theatre\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at the CornerHOUSE Theatre</a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-09-11T19:00:00Z\">Friday 11 September 2026, 7.00pm</time>\n-<time datetime=\"2026-09-11T21:30:00Z\">Friday 11 September 2026, 9.30pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Free</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>The first in a series of community screenings of the People's Emergency Briefing - a 50 minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/peoples-emergency-briefing-kingston-methodist-church\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church</a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-09-12T17:00:00Z\">Saturday 12 September 2026, 5.00pm</time>\n-<time datetime=\"2026-09-12T19:00:00Z\">Saturday 12 September 2026, 7.00pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Free</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>Join a screening of the People's Emergency Briefing - a 50-minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/peoples-emergency-briefing-new-malden-library\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at New Malden Library</a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-09-16T13:00:00Z\">Wednesday 16 September 2026, 1.00pm</time>\n-<time datetime=\"2026-09-16T14:30:00Z\">Wednesday 16 September 2026, 2.30pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Free</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>Join a screening of the People's Emergency Briefing - a 50-minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n    <div class=\"views-row\"><div class=\"views-field views-field-nothing\"><span class=\"field-content\"><div class=\"event-card\">\n  <h2><a href=\"/events/peoples-emergency-briefing-all-saints-church\" hreflang=\"en-gb\">People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at All Saints Church</a></h2>\n  \n  <div class=\"right-group\">\n    <div class=\"date\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-10-05T19:00:00Z\">Monday 5 October 2026, 7.00pm</time>\n-<time datetime=\"2026-10-05T21:00:00Z\">Monday 5 October 2026, 9.00pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n    <div class=\"location\"> </div>\n    <div class=\"price\"><span>Free</span></div>\n    <div class=\"body\"><p>Join a screening of the People's Emergency Briefing - a 50-minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.</p></div>\n  </div>\n</div></span></div></div>\n\n    </div>\n  \n      \n          </div>\n</div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          \n          \n                  </div>\n      </div>\n\n          \n      </main>\n\n</div>\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--footer-feedback-section region region-footer-feedback-section\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--footer-feedback-section\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-pagefeedbackblock-2\" class=\"block block-bbd-block block-bbd-block-page-feedback-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"bbd-feedback-block\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Page feedback\">\n  <div class=\"badge-text-wrapper\">\n          <span class=\"badge-text\">\n        Give feedback about this page\n      </span>\n    \n    <span class=\"badge-btn\">\n      <a href=\"#/\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#collapseFeedback\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapseFeedback\" class=\"reveal\">\n        <span class=\"view_collapseFeedback collapse out\"> Show <i class=\"fa fa-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"false\"></i></span>\n        <span class=\"hide_collapseFeedback collapse in\"> Hide <i class=\"fa fa-chevron-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span>\n      </a>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feedback-form-text feedback-form-page collapse in\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Feedback form\">\n      <p>Use our online form to tell us what you think of this page.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button\" href=\"/form/website-feedback-form\">Give your feedback</a></p>\n<p>To comment on council services, please <a href=\"/your-council/contact-us\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"96d2d2cd-d7cd-409e-9a7b-ccfc83ee7dee\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" title=\"Contact us\">contact us</a>.</p>\n<p>To take part in interviews and surveys to help us improve our services, you can <a href=\"https://p.consentkit.com/4a407728-06a3-48ce-a82b-927563901e7e\">join our user research panel</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n          </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n\n          <footer class=\"lgd-footer\">\n\n                      \n                      <div class=\"lgd-footer__footer\">\n          <div class=\"lgd-container\">\n            <div class=\"lgd-row\">\n              <div class=\"lgd-row__full\">\n                \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--footer region region-footer\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--footer\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-footerlogo\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-contentd8f1889f-ce4a-4165-aa32-5e8de2dfe0fb\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"></div>\n      \n  </div>\n<div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-newslettersubscriptionblockinfooter\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-contentc7fe899e-7a1b-4f69-af26-855a55f75ad4\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-title field--type-string field--label-hidden field__item\">Sign up to our newsletter</div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-description field--type-text field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>Get the latest Kingston news and events by email.</p></div>\n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-button field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item\"><a href=\"https://kingston.us2.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=4f9693900f570d3a4ca3b