            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-gb\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n  <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"The first in a series of community screenings of the People&#039;s Emergency Briefing - a 50 minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.\" />\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.kingston.gov.uk/events/peoples-emergency-briefing-cornerhouse-theatre\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"The first in a series of community screenings of the People&#039;s Emergency Briefing - a 50 minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at the CornerHOUSE Theatre\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RBKingston\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 (LocalGov Drupal | https://localgovdrupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/themes/custom/bbd_localgov/images/icons/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n\n    <title>People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at the CornerHOUSE Theatre | Royal Borough of Kingston upon Thames</title>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" media=\"all\" href=\"/sites/default/files/css/css_cSsuLHgM5ByCLxlH-9ja2Dg6ahJOILKaXxAYuZrc2Tg.css?delta=0&amp;language=en-gb&amp;theme=bbd_localgov&amp;include=eJxtkOFuwyAMhF8IwiMhA5eUBXBknDZ9-yXbKm10_3zfWfbpQkg-FI6rC6_Jb7TAz0AKFFdzcRVqvZBmbm7QJkAV4nFs3JH8nMspu1vQIFRMZIGLXDduaNqn8wOVhe8-UIe1lJJVtidDSyTf60n2jcpEH3QYHFpyW1_sR5qZm9IDnSvcr3l6IFyymz9_XBBQirLXMDq44319ZqkWIixvzl7KgJ