ty</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/benefits-and-support\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2624\">Benefits and support</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/care-support-for-adults\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2601\">Care and support for adults</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/children-young-people-and-families\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2775\">Children, young people and families</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/schools-and-learning\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2762\">Schools and learning </a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/your-council\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2707\">Your Council</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/business-and-licensing\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2952\">Business and licensing </a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/health-and-wellbeing\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2797\">Health and wellbeing</a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/safety-crime-and-emergencies\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2844\">Safety, crime and emergencies </a>\n              </li>\n                <li class=\"menu-item\">\n        <a href=\"/climate-and-sustainability\" data-drupal-link-system-path=\"node/2941\">Climate and sustainability </a>\n              </li>\n        </ul>\n  \n\n\n  </nav>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n                <button class=\"menu-opener\">\n                  <span class=\"menu-opener__show\">Show more</span>\n                  <span class=\"menu-opener__hide\">Show less</span>\n                </button>\n              </div>\n            \n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n  \n  \n      \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--breadcrumb region region-breadcrumb\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--breadcrumb\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-breadcrumbs-scarfolk\" class=\"block block-system block-system-breadcrumb-block\">\n  \n    \n      \n  \n\n  <nav class=\"breadcrumbs\" aria-labelledby=\"system-breadcrumbs\">\n    <h2 id=\"system-breadcrumbs\" class=\"visually-hidden\">Breadcrumbs</h2>\n    <ol class=\"breadcrumbs__list\">\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                      <a class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/\">Home</a>\n                    </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                      <a class=\"breadcrumbs__link\" href=\"/events\">Events</a>\n                    </li>\n              <li class=\"breadcrumbs__item\">\n                        People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church\n                  </li>\n                </ol>\n  </nav>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n          </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--messages region region-messages\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--messages\">\n      <div data-drupal-messages-fallback class=\"hidden\"></div>\n\n    </div>\n\n          </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n\n  <main class=\"main\" id=\"main-content\"> \n          \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--content-top region region-content-top\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--content-top\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-page-header-block-scarfolk\" class=\"block block-localgov-core block-localgov-page-header-block\">\n  \n    \n      \n  \n\n\n  <div class=\"lgd-page-title-block\">\n          <h1 class=\"lgd-page-title-block__title \">\n        People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church\n              </h1>\n    \n                  <p class=\"lgd-page-title-block__subheader\">Join a screening of the People&#039;s Emergency Briefing - a 50-minute documentary film highlighting the impacts of climate and nature breakdown on everyday life in the UK.</p>\n          \n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n          </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n    \n    \n                                <div class=\"lgd-main-content\">\n        \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--content region region-content\">\n\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--content\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-localgov-mainpagecontent-scarfolk--2\" class=\"block block-system block-system-main-block\">\n  \n    \n      \n\n  \n\n\n\n\n<article class=\"localgov-event node node--type-localgov-event node--with-restricted-width node--promoted node--view-mode-full\">\n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n              \n    <div class=\"node__restricted-width-section\">\n      \n            \n      <div class=\"localgov-event__content node__content\">\n        \n        \n            <div class=\"field field--name-field-event-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item\">  <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/sites/default/files/2026-08/Social%20media%20%20NEB%20Kingston%20Methodist%20Church%20%281%29.png\" width=\"940\" height=\"788\" alt=\"People&#039;s Emergency Briefing\" />\n\n</div>\n      \n        \n            <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-date field--type-date-recur field--label-hidden field__item\">  <div class=\"date-recur-date\"><time datetime=\"2026-09-12T17:00:00Z\">Saturday 12 September 2026, 5.00pm</time>\nto <time datetime=\"2026-09-12T19:00:00Z\">7.00pm</time>\n</div>\n\n\n</div>\n      \n\n        \n        <div class=\"event-price\">\n          \n            <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-price field--type-entity-reference field--label-hidden field__item\">Free</div>\n      \n        </div>\n\n        \n            <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-call-to-action field--type-link field--label-hidden field__item\"><a href=\"https://www.tickettailor.com/events/kingstonmethodistchurch/2304087?fbclid=IwY2xjawThYcdwZG9mBWV4dG4DYWVtAjEwAHNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR7g3ooSW3Yyx5diUxy3dWdKxFCj6hg3c9pR8-zNEF6XJhSJNHW5Rox3Kmn76g_aem_FL9bHX9K1prqvGJOEHchlw\">Book your free tickets</a></div>\n      \n        \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"><p>A special community screening: The People’s Emergency Briefing #PEBuk</p>\n<p>What’s happening with climate and nature, and what does it mean for everyday life in the UK?</p>\n<p>Join us for a screening of the People’s Emergency Briefing - an eye-opening 50-minute film bringing together nine leading UK scientists and experts with the latest evidence and why it matters for things like:</p>\n<p>🌧️ Extreme weather<br>🍞 Food security<br>🏥 Health<br>💷 Cost of living</p>\n<p>The film is based on the National Emergency Briefing in Westminster (featured by ITV, Channel 4 and The Times) with appearances from Chris Packham, Deborah Meaden, and a range of voices from across the UK.</p>\n<p>After the film there will be an open discussion about what it means for our community and what we can do locally.</p>\n<p>Seats are free but limited so please book in advance. The briefing was developed for an adult audience, so the film is only appropriate for ages 16 and above.</p>\n<p>Bring a friend, neighbour or family member: everyone is welcome.</p>\n<p>Note there is limited parking at the church; we recommend instead using public transport. The K1 and K4 buses stop directly opposite the church.</p>\n<p>If after booking you are unable to attend, we’d be very grateful if you could let us know so that we can re-allocate your ticket to someone else.</p></div>\n      \n        \n\n\n\n<div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar\">\n\n<button class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__trigger\" type=\"button\" name=\"addToCalendarTrigger\">\n  \n\n\n<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"lgd-icon localgov-add-to-calendar__trigger-icon\">\n  <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.1.1 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M152 64H296V24C296 10.75 306.7 0 320 0C333.3 0 344 10.75 344 24V64H384C419.3 64 448 92.65 448 128V448C448 483.3 419.3 512 384 512H64C28.65 512 0 483.3 0 448V128C0 92.65 28.65 64 64 64H104V24C104 10.75 114.7 0 128 0C141.3 0 152 10.75 152 24V64zM48 448C48 456.8 55.16 464 64 464H384C392.8 464 400 456.8 400 448V192H48V448z\"/></svg></span>  <span class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__trigger-text\">\n    Add to Calendar\n  </span>\n</button>\n\n  <dialog class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog\">\n    <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog-close\">\n      <button class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__dialog-close-button\" type=\"button\" name=\"closeAddToCalendarDialog\">\n        Close\n      </button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__items\">\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"    https://www.google.com/calendar/r/eventedit?text=People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church\n                        \" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Add to Google Calendar</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"data:text/calendar;charset=utf8,BEGIN:VCALENDAR%0AVERSION:2.0%0ABEGIN:VEVENT%0ASUMMARY:People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church%0AEND:VEVENT%0AEND:VCALENDAR\">Add to iCal</a>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"localgov-add-to-calendar__item\">\n        <a href=\"data:text/calendar;charset=utf8,BEGIN:VCALENDAR%0AVERSION:2.0%0ABEGIN:VEVENT%0ASUMMARY:People&#039;s Emergency Briefing at Kingston Methodist Church%0AEND:VEVENT%0AEND:VCALENDAR\">Add to Outlook</a>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n  </dialog>\n\n</div>\n\n        \n  <div class=\"field field--name-field-address field--type-address field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Address</div>\n              <div class=\"field__item\"><p class=\"address\" translate=\"no\"><span class=\"address-line1\">Kingston Methodist Church</span><br>\n<span class=\"postal-code\">KT1 2UJ</span><br>\n<span class=\"country\">United Kingdom</span></p></div>\n          </div>\n\n  <div class=\"field field--name-localgov-event-categories field--type-entity-reference field--label-above\">\n    <div class=\"field__label\">Categories</div>\n          <div class=\"field__items\">\n              <div class=\"field__item\">Climate change events</div>\n              </div>\n      </div>\n\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    \n  </div>\n\n      </div>\n        \n      </main>\n\n</div>\n\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--footer-feedback-section region region-footer-feedback-section\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--footer-feedback-section\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-pagefeedbackblock-2\" class=\"block block-bbd-block block-bbd-block-page-feedback-block\">\n  \n    \n      <div class=\"bbd-feedback-block\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Page feedback\">\n  <div class=\"badge-text-wrapper\">\n          <span class=\"badge-text\">\n        Give feedback about this page\n      </span>\n    \n    <span class=\"badge-btn\">\n      <a href=\"#/\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#collapseFeedback\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"collapseFeedback\" class=\"reveal\">\n        <span class=\"view_collapseFeedback collapse out\"> Show <i class=\"fa fa-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"false\"></i></span>\n        <span class=\"hide_collapseFeedback collapse in\"> Hide <i class=\"fa fa-chevron-up\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></span>\n      </a>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n\n      <div class=\"feedback-form-text feedback-form-page collapse in\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Feedback form\">\n      <p>Use our online form to tell us what you think of this page.</p>\n<p><a class=\"button\" href=\"/form/website-feedback-form\">Give your feedback</a></p>\n<p>To comment on council services, please <a href=\"/your-council/contact-us\" data-entity-type=\"node\" data-entity-uuid=\"96d2d2cd-d7cd-409e-9a7b-ccfc83ee7dee\" data-entity-substitution=\"canonical\" title=\"Contact us\">contact us</a>.</p>\n<p>To take part in interviews and surveys to help us improve our services, you can <a href=\"https://p.consentkit.com/4a407728-06a3-48ce-a82b-927563901e7e\">join our user research panel</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n          </div>\n    \n  </div>\n\n\n          <footer class=\"lgd-footer\">\n\n                      \n                      <div class=\"lgd-footer__footer\">\n          <div class=\"lgd-container\">\n            <div class=\"lgd-row\">\n              <div class=\"lgd-row__full\">\n                \n  \n  \n  \n\n  <div class=\"lgd-region lgd-region--footer region region-footer\">\n\n          <div class=\"lgd-container padding-horizontal\">\n    \n    <div class=\"lgd-region__inner lgd-region__inner--footer\">\n      <div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-footerlogo\" class=\"block block-block-content block-block-contentd8f1889f-ce4a-4165-aa32-5e8de2dfe0fb\">\n  \n    \n      \n            <div class=\"field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field__item\"></div>\n      \n  </div>\n<div id=\"block-bbd-localgov-newslettersubscriptionblockinfooter\