            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=UTF-8",
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en-gb\" dir=\"ltr\" prefix=\"og: https://ogp.me/ns#\" class=\"sticky-header-html\">\n  <head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Bring the whole family along for a fun and festive screening of a much-loved Christmas classic at Christ Church, Surbiton Hill, in support of Momentum Children&#039;s Charity. Treats, snacks and drinks available to buy and your chance to win fantastic seasonal raffle prizes.\" />\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow\" />\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.kingston.gov.uk/events/movie-magic-momentum-christmas-special\" />\n<link rel=\"image_src\" href=\"https://www.kingston.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2025-11/Film%20Poster%20Nov%202025%20%281%29.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Bring the whole family along for a fun and festive screening of a much-loved Christmas classic at Christ Church, Surbiton Hill, in support of Momentum Children&#039;s Charity. Treats, snacks and drinks available to buy and your chance to win fantastic seasonal raffle prizes.\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Movie Magic: A Momentum Christmas Special\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:site\" content=\"@RBKingston\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image\" content=\"https://www.kingston.gov.uk/sites/default/files/2025-11/Film%20Poster%20Nov%202025%20%281%29.png\" />\n<meta name=\"twitter:image:alt\" content=\"Movie Magic\" />\n<meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"Drupal 10 (LocalGov Drupal | https://localgovdrupal.org)\" />\n<meta name=\"MobileOptimized\" content=\"width\" />\n<meta name=\"HandheldFriendly\" content=\"true\" />\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/themes/custom/bbd_localgov/images/icons/favicon.ico\" type=\"image/vnd.microsoft.icon\" />\n\n    <title>Movie Magic: A Momentum Christmas Special | Royal Borough